DESCRIPTION:World Children's Day falls on November 20\, the date the United
  Nations General Assembly adopted the Declaration of the Rights of the Chi
 ld in 1959 and\, thirty years later to the day\, the Convention on the Rig
 hts of the Child. UNICEF runs it as a day of action for children and\, inc
 reasingly\, by children: the signature event is a "kid takeover\," in whic
 h young people step into adult roles in media\, politics\, business and sp
 ort. The observance is older than its current name\, and the UN's own page
 s for it no longer explain where it began.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/
 holiday/world-childrens-day/
